WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Intake draws charge into the cylinder.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Compression and power follow; exhaust clears the cylinder.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A four-stroke cycle spans two crankshaft turns.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A real engine has complex valve timing and gas flow. Source: U.S. DOE.
